OL,3,AFour plead guilty to arson attack on
OL,4,AJewish community ambulances
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour men have pleaded guilty to
OL,7,Fdestroying four Jewish community
OL,8,Fambulances in an arson attack causing
OL,9,F#1m of damage in north-west London.
OL,11,FHamza Iqbal, 20, Rehan Khan, 19, Judex
OL,12,FAtshatshi, and Saif Ali, both aged 18,
OL,13,Fpleaded guilty at the Old Bailey to a
OL,14,Fcharge of destroying or damaging
OL,15,Fproperty being reckless whether life
OL,16,Fwould be endangered.
OL,18,FThe attack, which took place in the
OL,19,Fearly hours of 23 March, saw four
OL,20,Fvehicles operated by the charity
OL,21,FHatzola set alight in Golders Green.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/40
