OL,3,AKing Haakon VIII takes the throne in
OL,4,ANorway following death of Harald V
OL,5,
OL,6,FKing Haakon VIII has taken the throne
OL,7,Fin Norway following the death of his
OL,8,Ffather, Harald V
OL,10,FHarald, who was on the throne for 35
OL,11,Fyears, died early on Friday at the
OL,12,Fnational hospital in Oslo where he was
OL,13,Fbeing treated for a rare blood
OL,14,Fcondition
OL,16,FThe Norwegian PM says "a whole nation
OL,17,Fis in mourning" following his death -
OL,18,FOslo's mayor says she has cancelled her
OL,19,Fwedding, which was scheduled for today
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/40
