OL,3,AKing Haakon VIII takes the throne in
OL,4,ANorway following death of Harald V
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe has opted to keep the family's
OL,7,Flong-standing royal motto: "All for
OL,8,FNorway"
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/40
