OL,3,AOslo mayor calls off wedding ceremony
OL,4,Aafter death of Norway's king
OL,5,
OL,6,FKing Harald reigned for 35 years and
OL,7,Fdied at the national hospital in
OL,8,FNorway's capital where he was being
OL,9,Ftreated for a rare blood condition. His
OL,10,Fson, King Haakon VIII, became Norway's
OL,11,Fnew monarch on Friday.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/40
